  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-ORDER, SQL-KEY-02, SQL-KEY-03: Over the twelve Text values of OG and its indexed copy OGI (b, A, a, B, c, a, C, b, B, A, a-umlaut, a in insertion order), which spelling and which row (First, Last, Min of id) represents each group, and in what order do the groups, DISTINCT values, and ties under ORDER BY t come out without further ordering (one GetRows(100) per statement)? Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-order opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
